WEBVTT

00:06:57.478 --> 00:07:01.149
the eight years of occupation,

00:07:01.173 --> 00:07:04.827
the insurgency that's been
unleashed on your people,

00:07:04.851 --> 00:07:07.676
the tens of thousands,
the hundreds of thousands

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:10.164
of civilian deaths?

00:07:12.914 --> 00:07:14.760
All because of oil.

00:07:15.628 --> 00:07:17.144
You can't help but think that.

00:07:17.588 --> 00:07:18.969
You talk about it.

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:22.176
It's in the forefront
of your mind, always.

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:24.715
You say, "How is that possible?"

00:07:25.207 --> 00:07:27.628
And this man, he's everyman --

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:30.751
your grandfather, your uncle,